        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Roberta Flack, Donny Hathaway\n- Works: \"The Closer I Get to You\"\n- Topics: music genres, musical roles\n\nFacts:\n- Donny Edward Hathaway was born on October 1, 1945, and he was an American singer, songwriter, arranger, and pianist.\n- Donny Hathaway worked in jazz, blues, soul, and gospel music.\n- \"The Closer I Get to You\" is a romantic ballad performed by Roberta Flack and Donny Hathaway.\n- Roberta Flack was an African American singer-songwriter associated with jazz, soul, R&B, and folk music.\n- Donny Hathaway was an African American soul musician.\n- Donny Hathaway died on January 13, 1979.",
